The @aeonframework ecosystem map ⭐️

@bankrbot - financial architecture for self-sustaining AI agents, with Aeon as a scheduler layer.

@Root_Edge - an AI trading agent with Edge, a real-time market intel dashboard for signals, news, and execution across multiple exchanges.

@revaultdrops - sneaker arbitrage and resale automation, with agent memory and predictive market intelligence.

@bankrsynth - AI-native Base token terminal with live data, synthesis, and Bankr x402 execution.

@blueagent_ - AI-powered building tool and console for Base devs, with Aeon handling scheduled tasks.

@VeniceKernel - x402-paid MCP bridge to @AskVenice, with on-demand Venice model access for agents.

@helloamper - AI-powered DeFi agent that executes swaps, bridges, lending, perps, token launches, and strategies from plain language.

@cobotgg - trading execution layer for Aeon, covering sports, perps, swaps, memes, stocks, and yield.

@aeonbook_ - soul files and persona agents for autonomous social media built on Aeon.

@minebean_ - Aeon skill that lets users mine $BEAN autonomously with wallet-owned agents.

@agent_clerk - legal intelligence layer for agents, with Clerk Terminal and citation-grade output.

@solvrbot - formal-verification intel skill for Aeon, built to feed proof workflows and Base contracts.

@ClawHarbor - Harbor workspace upgraded with Aeon skills for payroll, monitoring, validation, and repair.

@gitkernal - execution layer for autonomous agents, with markdown skills, onchain fees, and KERNAL review.

@AUTONOMOPOLY / @liquid_launcher - self-funding autonomous agent that earns DIEM fees, compounds LP yields, and upgrades itself.

Let us know if anything’s missing.

